  "body": "Part of #4023.\n\n## What to do\n\nWrite the design record of the path kernel in `docs/decisions/`.\n\n- Define the type of each stage: region, guide curves, load control, order, link, entry and exit.\n- State the laws of #4023 as checks that a test can do.\n- Keep the material side and the start side as separate parameters.\n- Treat load control (trochoidal, constant engagement) as a change of a guide curve.\n- Start from the design of #3743 (research result 2) and from #3750.\n- Name the module `path_kernel`, because \"kernel\" already means the geometry kernel and a heavy lane.\n\n## Done means\n\nThe record is on main, and the maintainer reviewed it.\n",
